detaileddescription.para:
The subscriberList array shall provide exactly [max_signal] entries.


The subscriberList array shall also include the reserved entries for signals below EDF_HSM_USER_SIGNAL.

Example: typedefenum{
SIGNAL_1=EDF_HSM_USER_SIGNAL,
SIGNAL_2,
LAST_SIGNAL
}hsm_eventSignal_t;

staticEDF_activeObject_bitmask_tsubscriberList[LAST_SIGNAL];

EDF_activeObject_pubSubInit(subscriberList,LAST_SIGNAL);
